# spec-trio iteration log

Record each attempt, its findings, verification results and remaining work here.
The driver owns BACKLOG.md: it marks a task complete only after passing gates
and any required merge. Completion markers in this log cannot skip pending work.

## Entry format

```
## iter N · <UTC timestamp>
Task: <spec section and task>
What changed: <files and behavior>
Verification: <test command, result, evidence path>
Next: <remaining work or reason human attention is required>
```

